AArch64 stop-admission-unfenced
"stop-admission-fenced without the starting CPU's barrier (P0): the starting CPU loads the stop word before its bit is seen, and the leader misses the bit"
{
0:X1=a; 0:X3=b;
1:X1=a; 1:X3=b;
}
 P0          | P1          ;
 MOV W0,#1   | MOV W0,#1   ;
 STR W0,[X1] | STR W0,[X3] ;
 NOP         | DMB ISH     ;
 LDR W2,[X3] | LDR W2,[X1] ;
exists (0:X2=0 /\ 1:X2=0)
